--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/webridge-video-policy.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"@agent-wechat/cli": patch
+---
+
+Ignore automatic downloads of received videos and their thumbnails, including queued work from previous versions. Remove the 50 MiB source and 25 MiB playback policies for sent videos. Preserve compatible MP4 sources without size, dimension or frame-rate targets, and convert incompatible codecs at source dimensions and frame rate without a bitrate or file-size budget. Keep descriptor integer bounds, account authorization, integrity, cancellation, idempotency, uncertain receipts and recovery checks. This does not establish WeChat server acceptance or recipient playback for arbitrary large videos.
